"The maps illustrate some changes to the town of Lakeside over a period of nine years (2000 – 2009).": "",
"Overall, the town experienced considerable changes during the period shown. The most noticeable differences between the two maps are the expansion of the industrial complex and the disappearance of the residential area.": "",
"As can be seen from the maps, from 2000 to 2009, the housing area in the northwest of Lakeside remained unchanged.": "",
"During the same period, the derelict warehouses and the old town were demolished to make way for a new car park and offices.": "",
"The arts centre and the western residential area were also destroyed and replaced by a new multi-screen cinema and a shopping centre.": "",
"The school next to the arts centre was relocated a little closer to the river.": "",
"Turning to the other features, we can see that the southern residential area disappeared, while the industrial complex in the southeast was significantly expanded.": "",
"A large area of the woodland was cleared, whereas the lake became a small pond.": "",
