"The maps illustrate some changes to Headly village and Fonton in three different time periods (1925, 1975, and the present).": "",
"Overall, Headly village and Fonton have experienced considerable changes during the period shown. The main developments are the expansion of transportation routes and the appearance of some facilities.": "",
"In 1925, Headly village and Fonton were completely separated.": "",
"Fonton had a railway line running through it from east to north, while Headly had a small road crossing it from west to north.": "",
"In 1975, Headly and Fonton were significantly expanded.": "",
"In Headly, the small road was replaced by a larger road and extended east to connect with Fonton.": "",
"A housing estate, a leisure centre, and a local shop were constructed in Headly.": "",
"Currently, Headly village merges with Fonton to become Headly suburbs.": "",
"The railway line in Fonton is extended to the west.": "",
"A railway station, a hotel, and a business park are built near the railway line.": "",
